    "long_instructions": "## Define Your Project\r\nGoal: Plan your model before you train it.\r\n\r\nMove your Data Scientist to each stop as you start it. Keep AI Lab open in a new tab.\r\n- **Define Stop 1:** Open your dataset in AI Lab. Find the labels you could predict. On this map, drag the star to one label.\r\n- **Define Stop 2:** Who will use your model? Write one person or group.\r\n- **Define Stop 3:** Find the features in your dataset. Drag two features into the boxes. Write why you picked them.\r\n- **Define Stop 4:** Don't train yet. Use what you already know to finish the \"If ..., then ...\" rule.\r\n- **Define Stop 5:** Train your model with your label and two features. Save Tree 1 to your Backpack. Add Tree 1 to this map. Then write one way your rule is different from Tree 1.\r\n\r\nYou are done when all five stops have an answer and Tree 1 is on your map.",
